<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1566_5661.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unßer</unclear> fründtlich willig dienst, unnd was wir
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrenn</unclear> liebs unnd guots vermögend, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>. Fromm,
